{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nA read-only page listing git worktrees and stashes, with a diff preview. Kept out of the Git page, which is already dense.\n\n## Non-goals\n- Read-only, like every vig page: the view inspects, it never mutates (no start/stop/kill/apply/switch). No `worktree add/remove`, no `stash apply/drop`, and no switching the working directory to another worktree.\n\n## Sub-issues\n- #104 — Worktrees: page skeleton\n- #105 — Worktrees: worktrees pane\n- #106 — Worktrees: stashes pane\n- #107 — Worktrees: diff preview pane\n\n(suggested order: skeleton → worktrees → stashes → diff preview)\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:52Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":103,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Worktrees view"}
